      "content": "wait, i'm getting confused again. if the total he needs is 600mg, and the bottle is 400mg per 5ml... so 600mg is 7.5ml, right? \n\nsince the doctor said to give it twice a day, should i just give him the 7.5ml each time? that way he definitely gets the full amount the doctor wanted every single time. i feel like like it's much better to give a bit extra to make sure the bacteria is totally gone. is that a better way to do it?",
